ften. <br/>The server is on a new database, so it doesn't really matter what you do there.<br/>Also, I'm going to be looking for a beta team. Anyone who becomes a regular on this server rather than the normal one will get a special forum rank, a special forum all to themselves and admin/mod on the server.<br/><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:25pt;line-height:1.3em\"><a href=\"http://ventmob.com/index.php/topic,2432.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Please post all feedback / bug reports in <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">this thread</span></a></span></div>","sig":"I code your babies.<br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://bit.ly/vmajack\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"archive/assets/shared/posts/52cd7c09f222df7f.png\"/></a><br/><a href=\"http://bit.ly/vmfretta\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"archive/assets/shared/posts/52cd7c09f222df7f.png\"/></a></div>"}]}